;#10;It rained 10% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 72 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"103.33166666666665\" cy=\"346.6111111111111\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 30%&amp;#10;It rained 21% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 67 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"162.56208955223877\" cy=\"305.94029850746267\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 44%&amp;#10;It rained 24% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 67 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"214.4997014925373\" cy=\"295.07462686567163\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 64%&amp;#10;It rained 32% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 69 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"285.9452173913043\" cy=\"265.94202898550725\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 78%&amp;#10;It rained 41% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 64 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"333.51156249999997\" cy=\"234.125\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 89%&amp;#10;It rained 50% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 68 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"373.52852941176474\" cy=\"200.0\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 99%&amp;#10;It rained 61% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 132 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"406.985\" cy=\"158.63636363636363\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(31%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p>In Bangui the forecast is most skilful in\n<b>autumn</b> (-0.19) and least in\n<b>winter</b> (-0.71).</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th>Season</th><th class=\"num\">Days</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Rain days</th><th class=\"num\">Skill score</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Avg error</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>winter</td><td class='num'>164</td><td class='num'>4%</td><td class='num'>-0.708</td><td class='num'>10.9%</td></tr><tr><td>summer</td><td class='num'>176</td><td class='num'>45%</td><td class='num'>-0.360</td><td class='num'>32.4%</td></tr><tr><td>spring</td><td class='num'>149</td><td class='num'>30%</td><td class='num'>-0.268</td><td class='num'>22.2%</td></tr><tr><td>autumn</td><td class='num'>171</td><td class='num'>43%</td><td class='num'>-0.190</td><td class='num'>25.4%</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">Four-way splits of a two-year record are thin, so read the\nordering as indicative. Coarser binning is used here than for the annual curve\nfor the same reason.</p>\n"},"lat":4.36122,"lon":18.55496,"n":660,"n_cities":216,"name":"Bangui","offset_days":0,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.06,"lo":0.0,"mean":0.012727272727272728,"n":121,"obs":0.03305785123966942,"sig":false},{"hi":0.22,"lo":0.06,"mean":0.12805555555555553,"n":72,"obs":0.09722222222222222,"sig":false},{"hi":0.37,"lo":0.22,"mean":0.29537313432835816,"n":67,"obs":0.208955223880597,"sig":false},{"hi":0.55,"lo":0.37,"mean":0.4420895522388059,"n":67,"obs":0.2388059701492537